  "notes": "{倒|たお}す means to knock down or defeat. A transitive godan verb.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {倒|たお}す (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧): to knock down\n- ⟦{倒|たお}れる→倒れる：01160_taoreru⟧ (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧): to fall down, to collapse\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{敵|てき}→敵：03546_teki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{倒|たお}す: to defeat the enemy\n- ⟦{木|き}→木：00524_ki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{倒|たお}す: to fell a tree\n- ⟦{花瓶|かびん}→花瓶：02867_kabin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{倒|たお}す: to knock over a vase\n- ⟦{政権|せいけん}→政権：12883_seiken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{倒|たお}す: to overthrow a regime\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{倒|たお}して⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ typically means \"is lying down\" (result state) rather than \"is knocking down.\"",
